<       # The repo-root package.json is the third version record and is not one of
<       # the release config's bump paths, so the action above leaves it behind.
<       # Align it in the same commit: the sharedConstants entry in
<       # .claudinite-checks.json holds all three identical, and cer/version-sync
<       # compares the manifest against this file by name — without this step both
<       # go BLOCKING after every daily patch bump. Replaces the exact one-line
<       # version token (same discipline as bump.mjs) so the diff stays one line.
<       - name: Align the root package.json to the bumped version
<         run: |
<           node -e '
<             const fs = require("node:fs");
